<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11408" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cŏthurnātus</span></b> , a,
		um, adj.
		cothurnus, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of</i> or <i>pertaining to the</i>
			cothurnus, lit. <i>buskined;</i> hence, <i>elevated, lofty, tragic</i> (opp. excalceatus,
			comic, <i><span class="en">Sen. Ep. 8, 8</span></i>; <i><span class="en">76, 31</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">not ante-Aug.): Maronis grande opus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Mart.
					5, 5, 8</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Lycophron, Ov. lb. 529: vates,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. Am. 2, 18, 18</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">deae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					F. 5, 348</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sermo,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Macr. S. 7, 5 <i>fin.</i></span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">scelera,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Lact. 6, 20</span></i>
			.—* adv.: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cŏ-thurnātē</span></b> , <i>loftily, tragically;</i> only <i>comp.</i> (late Lat.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cothurnatius,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Amm. 28, 1, 4</span></i>
			.</div>
